 "title": "Hegel, Differenz des Fichte'schen und Schelling'schen Systems der Philosophie (Jena, 1801), and the lectures on Plato in the Vorlesungen über die Geschichte der Philosophie II (Werke XIV, Berlin, 1833)",
 "edition": "G. W. F. Hegel, Differenz des Fichte'schen und Schelling'schen Systems der Philosophie in Beziehung auf Reinhold's Beyträge zur leichtern Uebersicht des Zustands der Philosophie zu Anfang des neunzehnten Jahrhunderts, 1stes Heft (Jena: Seidler, 1801) — Internet Archive 10045974 (Bayerische Staatsbibliothek), leaves n7–n60, OCR in session; G. W. F. Hegel, Vorlesungen über die Geschichte der Philosophie II, ed. K. L. Michelet, Werke XIV (Berlin: Duncker und Humblot, 1833), the first part of the lecture on Plato, pp. 169–241 (the life, the writings and the dialectic) — Internet Archive bub_gb_4ZpBzREnAIMC (digitized by Google), leaves n178–n250, OCR in session",
 "language": "deu",
 "license": {
  "payload": "Hegel (d. 1831) is public domain, as are the Differenzschrift (Jena: Seidler, 1801) and Michelet's edition of the lectures in the Werke (Berlin: Duncker und Humblot, 1833); Michelet died in 1893. The OCR was made in session from the Archive's page images (the Bayerische Staatsbibliothek's scan of 1801 and Google's of 1833) and is released with this seat record.",
  "record": "CC-BY-4.0 applies to this seat record only."
